---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";

const title = "About | Portugal Considered";
const description =
  "Portugal Considered provides practical, decision-driven travel guidance for planning a better Portugal vacation.";
---

<Base title={title} description={description}>
  <section class="about-intro">
    <div class="about-inner">
      <p class="eyebrow">About Portugal Considered</p>

      <h1>Better trips begin with better decisions.</h1>

      <p class="intro">
        Portugal Considered is practical travel guidance for people who want
        to experience Portugal well without trying to see everything.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="about-content">
    <div class="about-inner">
      <h2>Travel planning is mostly about choices.</h2>

      <p>
        Where should you go? How many days does a destination deserve?
        Should the Douro Valley be a day trip or an overnight stay? Do you
        need a car? Is changing hotels worth the time it takes?
      </p>

      <p>
        Those decisions shape a vacation long before a traveler arrives in
        Portugal. They also determine whether a trip feels relaxed and
        rewarding—or rushed and unnecessarily complicated.
      </p>

      <p>
        Portugal Considered is built around helping travelers make those
        choices thoughtfully.
      </p>

      <h2>We do not believe a better itinerary is a longer itinerary.</h2>

      <p>
        Portugal offers more worthwhile places than most travelers can
        reasonably fit into one vacation. Our goal is not to create the
        longest possible list of attractions, restaurants, hotels, or day
        trips.
      </p>

      <p>
        Instead, we focus on the decisions that help you decide what belongs
        in your trip, what deserves more time, and what may be better saved
        for another visit.
      </p>

      <h2>Practical guidance before the booking.</h2>

      <p>
        Hotels, trains, rental cars, tours, cruises, and transfers are easier
        to choose once the shape of the trip makes sense. That is why our
        approach starts with the travel decision first and the booking option
        second.
      </p>

      <p>
        When we recommend or link to a travel service, the goal is for it to
        support a trip that already makes sense—not to design the trip around
        something we can sell.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="about-closing">
    <div class="about-inner">
      <p class="eyebrow">Portugal, considered.</p>

      <h2>See enough. Experience more.</h2>

      <p>
        Whether you are planning your first Portugal vacation or returning to
        explore another part of the country, we want to help you spend less
        time wondering whether you planned the trip correctly—and more time
        enjoying the places you chose.
      </p>

      <a href="/destinations/">Start exploring Portugal →</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .about-intro {
    padding: 100px 28px 85px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .about-inner {
    max-width: 820px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 16px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-green);
  }

  h1 {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: Georgia, serif;
    font-size: clamp(44px, 6vw, 68px);
    line-height: 1.08;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .intro {
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 28px auto 0;
    font-size: 20px;
    color: var(--color-muted);
  }

  .about-content {
    padding: 70px 28px 80px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-sand);
  }

  .about-content h2,
  .about-closing h2 {
    margin: 55px 0 20px;
    font-family: Georgia, serif;
    font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 40px);
    line-height: 1.15;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .about-content h2:first-child {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .about-content p,
  .about-closing p {
    font-size: 18px;
  }

  .about-closing {
    padding: 75px 28px 80px;
    background: var(--color-sand);
  }

  .about-closing h2 {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .about-closing a {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 10px;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .about-closing a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .about-intro {
      padding: 70px 22px 60px;
    }

    .intro {
      font-size: 18px;
    }

    .about-content {
      padding: 55px 22px 60px;
    }

    .about-content p,
    .about-closing p {
      font-size: 17px;
    }

    .about-closing {
      padding: 55px 22px 60px;
    }
  }
</style>
